      en: ["The highest peak is Ismoil Somoni Peak at 7,495 meters", "Home to the Fedchenko Glacier, the longest in Eurasia at 77 km", "Junction point for five of the world's highest mountain ranges", "Average elevation of the plateau is approximately 4,000 meters", "A critical transit point on the ancient Silk Road routes", "Habitat for the world's largest population of Marco Polo sheep"],
