      en: ["The mountain range is approximately 1,600 kilometers long.", "The highest peak, Mount Taibai, reaches 3,767 meters.", "It separates the Yellow River and Yangtze River basins.", "Home to the distinct brown-and-white Qinling panda subspecies.", "The range marks the 800mm annual precipitation isohyet.", "It serves as a critical buffer for the South-to-North Water Diversion."],
      es: ["Longitud: 1.500 km", "Pico más alto: Monte Taibai (3.767 m)", "Anchura: 100–150 km", "Monos dorados: población de unos 10.000", "Población de pandas: unos 300 en las montañas Qinling", "Altitud media: 2.000 m"],
      pt: ["Comprimento: 1.500 km", "Pico mais alto: Monte Taibai (3.767 m)", "Largura: 100–150 km", "Macacos-dourados: população de cerca de 10.000", "População de pandas: cerca de 300 nas montanhas Qinling", "Altitude média: 2.000 m"],
